{"id":"n1-243","title":"～足りない","romaji":"～tarinai","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Expresses insufficiency or lack; 'not enough', 'insufficient'.","longExplanation":"The ～足りない pattern simply means that something is not sufficient in quantity, time, detail, ability, etc. It’s the negative form of 足りる ('to be enough').","formation":"Noun + (が) 足りない, Verb-casual + ほど/だけ + (が) 足りない","examples":[{"jp":"私の日本語の能力はまだまだ足りない。","romaji":"Watashi no nihongo no nouryoku wa madamada tarinai.","en":"My Japanese skills are still not enough.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日本語","vocabId":"1464530","reading":"にほんご"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"能力","vocabId":"1470370","reading":"のうりょく"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"まだまだ","vocabId":"1527150","reading":"まだまだ"},{"surface":"足り","vocabId":"1404740","reading":"たりる","baseForm":"足りる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8]},{"jp":"時間が足りないから、今すぐ行かなきゃ。","romaji":"Jikan ga tarinai kara, ima sugu ikanakya.","en":"We don't have enough time, so we must go right now.","words":[{"surface":"時間","vocabId":"1315920","reading":"じかん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"足り","vocabId":"1404740","reading":"たりる","baseForm":"足りる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"今","vocabId":"1288850","reading":"いま"},{"surface":"すぐ","vocabId":"1430610","reading":"すぐ"},{"surface":"行か","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"なきゃ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3]},{"jp":"彼の説明には詳細が足りない。","romaji":"Kare no setsumei ni wa shousai ga tarinai.","en":"His explanation lacks detail.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"説明","vocabId":"1386460","reading":"せつめい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","